<LanguageData>
  
  <!-- EN: 「Tenacity」Hyacinth -->
  <RKU_Storytellers_Hyacinth.label>「坚韧」风信子</RKU_Storytellers_Hyacinth.label>
  <!-- EN: Hyacinth is a veteran who survived the revolutionary army era. She once fought against the Kingdom's tyranny alongside Reilainei alongside Acacia's leadership. Although the revolution ultimately failed due to Azalea's biological weapon plague, the Eastern Front forces maintained their combat effectiveness, dispersing into underground work... \nHyacinth will provide more stable guerrilla-related events, as well as more frequent combat. -->
  <RKU_Storytellers_Hyacinth.description>风信子是一位经历过革命军时代的老兵，她曾经与瑞莱茵雪一同在革命军领导人金合欢的旗帜下对抗王国的暴政。虽然革命最后因为贵族映山红的生化武器瘟疫而失败了，但东线的部队仍保持着战斗力。她们化整为零，开始了地下工作......\n      风信子会提供更多更稳定的游击队相关事件，以及更加频繁的战斗。</RKU_Storytellers_Hyacinth.description>
  
</LanguageData>